sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Device as Medical Device
    participant EST as EstController
    participant Orch as EnrollmentOrchestrator
    participant DB as Gateway Database
    participant Factory as CaConnectorFactory
    participant CA as Active CA Backend
    participant PKCS as PkcsService

    Device->>EST: GET /.well-known/est/cacerts
    EST->>DB: Resolve enabled EST profile by host and path
    DB-->>EST: EST profile id
    EST->>Orch: GetCaCertsAsync(profileId)
    Orch->>DB: Load EST profile
    DB-->>Orch: Enabled profile
    Orch->>DB: Load active CA backend or profile backend
    DB-->>Orch: Enabled CA backend
    Orch->>Factory: CreateConnector(backend)
    Factory-->>Orch: ICaConnector
    Orch->>CA: GetCaCertificatesAsync()

    alt CA chain is available
        CA-->>Orch: CA certificates
        Orch->>PKCS: EncodeToPkcs7(caCerts)
        PKCS-->>Orch: PKCS#7 DER
        Orch-->>EST: PKCS#7
        EST->>PKCS: EncodeEstResponseBody(pkcs7)
        PKCS-->>EST: Base64 body
        EST-->>Device: 200 application/pkcs7-mime
        Device->>Device: Cache gateway CA chain for certificate validation
    else CA chain unavailable
        CA-->>Orch: Empty chain
        Orch-->>EST: InvalidOperationException
        EST-->>Device: 404 or 500 JSON error
    end
